y has one form. You do not use a subject.<br><br>  We often use the Imperative in ads to showcase a product and attract customers.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Sail with us to the Belize Barrier Reef!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Embark on an adventure!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Come and experience a once-in-a-lifetime journey! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Snorkel through coral reefs off the coast of Belize City. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Hop on board one of our glass-bottom boats! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "See why Charles Darwin described it as \"the most remarkable reef in the West Indies\" in 1842.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "coral ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "shell formations found in tropical waters ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Belize is home to a great variety of coral.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in an ad about Belize!", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "reef ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a ridge of sand or coral just below the surface of the sea ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Snorkel through coral reefs off the coast of Belize City.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vital ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "essential; necessary", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  This area is also well known to fishermen as it is vital to the fishing industry here in Belize. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "diverse ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "varied", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Visit an amazing diverse ecosystem, the Belize Barrier Reef!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "diversity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "variety ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Observe the reef's diversity of plants and animals first-hand.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "industry ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "economic activity; production", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a large fishing industry in Belize.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vulnerable ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to be hurt; in danger", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Enjoy the site designated a World  Heritage Site because of its vulnerable wildlife in 1996.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "yacht ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large luxury boat", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sail through the coral reef on our yacht!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "all-inclusive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all services are included in the price", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Enjoy an unforgettable cruise! Prices are all-inclusive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of a product you like, or a great tourist destination.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online and find ads about them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch or read the ads. Pay attention to the expressions they use.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an ad about the product (5-8 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your ad to your class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write 5-8 lines describing a product I like or a great tourist destination.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use exciting language with instructions to talk about the product or tourist destination.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what people/things do or did in the description.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "The Belize Barrier Reef is home to a large diversity of plants and animals, and is one of the most diverse ecosystems of the world. In 1996 it was designated a World Heritage Site because of its vulnerable wildlife."}, {"image": "", "time": "", "id": 2, "text": "Come and experience a once-in-a-lifetime journey! Sail with us to the Belize Barrier Reef! Embark on an adventure! Snorkel through coral reefs off the coast of Belize City. Hop on board one of our glass-bottom boats! See why Charles Darwin described it as \"the most remarkable reef in the West Indies\" in 1842."}, {"image": "", "time": "", "id": 3, "text": "The Great Blue Hole is Belize's top destination. It is also vital to the country's fishing industry. Spend a day on our yacht! Enjoy an unforgettable cruise! Prices are all-inclusive. Call 1-866- BE-LIZE for details!